Package: dataraft.dbt
Title: Dbt Components for DataRaft
Version: 0.1.0.9000
Authors@R: person("Jan-Hendrik", "Weinert", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "65009403+JanWein@users.noreply.github.com")
Description: Run dbt projects and publish their checked outputs as data products.
